  "thag1.90:1.1": "10 pañcakkhandhā pariññātā ",
  "thag1.90:1.2": "tiṭṭhanti chinnamūlakā ",
  "thag1.90:1.3": "vikkhīṇo jātisaṃsāro ",
  "thag1.90:1.4": "natthidāni punabbhavoti. ",
  "thag1.90:1.5": "sāmidatto thero. ",
  "thag1.90:1.6": "uddānaṃ thero samitigutto ca kassapo sīhasavhayo nīto sunāgo nāgito paviṭṭho ajjuno isi devasabho ca yo thero sāmidatto mahabbaloti. vaggo navamo. ",
